.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-EXPORT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-export
.Nd a capsule as in-toto, DSSE, RO-Crate or BagIt
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis export
.Fl -as Cm intoto | dsse | rocrate | bagit
.Op Fl k Ar key
.Op Fl p Ar key.pub
.Op Fl o Ar file | dir
.Op Fl f
.Ar dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis export
describes the capsule
.Ar dir
.Pq Xr noqtis-capsule 5
in a format other tools read.
The capsule must check first, with the key in its seal
.Pq Xr noqtis-check 1 ;
pin the key there with
.Fl p
before exporting.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm intoto
An in-toto Statement v1 (JSON): one subject per file, with its path and
SHA-256, and a predicate of type
.Lk https://rootcoder007.github.io/noqtis/spec/capsule/
holding the capsule's id, format, algorithm, key fingerprint, created
time and meta.
.It Cm dsse
That statement in a DSSE envelope
.Pq Ql application/vnd.in-toto+json ,
signed with
.Fl k
over the envelope's PAE.
Most DSSE tools do not verify post-quantum signatures;
.Xr noqtis-verify 1
.Fl -dsse
does.
.It Cm rocrate
RO-Crate 1.1 metadata
.Pq Pa ro-crate-metadata.json :
the folder as a Dataset whose identifier is the capsule's id, each file
with its size and SHA-256, the seal and the manifest as files.
Put it beside the capsule's files to make the folder a crate; it is not
listed in the manifest, so
.Ql noqtis check
then reports it as an
.Ql extra
file unless the folder is sealed again.
.It Cm bagit
A BagIt 1.0 bag (RFC 8493) in the new folder
.Fl o :
a copy of every file under
.Pa data/ ,
each checked against the manifest's SHA-256 as it is copied, its
.Pa manifest-sha256.txt ,
.Pa bag-info.txt
(the capsule's id as External-Identifier, Payload-Oxum),
.Pa bagit.txt ,
and the seal and the manifest as tag files listed in
.Pa tagmanifest-sha256.txt .
.El
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -as Ar format
The format, as above.
.It Fl k Ar key , Fl -key Ns = Ns Ar key
For
.Cm dsse :
the secret signature key.
.It Fl p Ar key.pub , Fl -pub Ns = Ns Ar key.pub
Its public key.
Default:
.Ar key Ns Pa .pub .
.It Fl o Ar file , Fl -out Ns = Ns Ar file
Write to
.Ar file
instead of standard output; for
.Cm bagit ,
the bag's folder, which must not exist.
.It Fl f , Fl -force
Replace
.Ar file
if it exists.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 3n -compact
.It 0
Exported.
.It 1
The capsule does not check.
.It 2
A usage error, a key that cannot be read, a file that changed while it
was copied, or a file or folder that cannot be written.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ noqtis export --as dsse -k me -o results.intoto.json results
$ noqtis verify -p me.pub --dsse results.intoto.json
$ noqtis export --as bagit -o results-bag results
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-check 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-verify 1 ,
.Xr nqdsse 3 ,
.Xr noqtis-capsule 5
.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
.%T in-toto Attestation Framework: Statement v1
.%U https://github.com/in-toto/attestation/blob/main/spec/v1/statement.md
.Re
.Rs
.%T DSSE: Dead Simple Signing Envelope
.%U https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse/blob/master/envelope.md
.Re
.Rs
.%T RO-Crate 1.1
.%U https://w3id.org/ro/crate/1.1
.Re
.Rs
.%R RFC 8493
.%T The BagIt File Packaging Format (V1.0)
.%D October 2018
.Re
